{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#card-zh","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的选中文本操作插件。它把悬浮工具条接入会话消息，并在右侧栏注册可复用的侧边提问标签。用户选中文字后可以把引用附到主输入框并随问题发送，也可以在继承主会话上下文的侧边会话中提问；侧边标签按主会话复用，关闭后归档。输入的选区以文本附件发送，上传不可用时改为普通文本，并提供引用预览、移除及中英文界面。适合需要针对对话中的一段内容继续追问、同时保留主会话的用户；不需要额外密钥或服务配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:316-327","client.js:907-963","client.js:995-1068"]}
{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#card-en","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Selection Actions adds a floating toolbar to DSH web chat. Select text to quote it in the main composer or ask in a reusable sidebar session with inherited context. Quotes use text attachments with a plain-text fallback. The UI supports Chinese and English; no extra key or service setup is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:316-327","client.js:907-963","client.js:995-1068"]}
