{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#feature-1","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「悬浮选区工具条」：在会话消息中选中文字后显示操作条，可选择加入主对话或在侧边提问；只从会话内容选取，最长截取 6000 字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:250-265","client.js:353-390"]}
{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#feature-2","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「把选区附到主输入框」：选择“加入对话”后，引用以可预览、可移除的胶囊显示在输入框上方；发送时通过会话接口携带引用与问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:275-314","client.js:175-205"]}
{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#feature-3","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「侧栏延续上下文提问」：“在侧边提问”会为当前会话创建 fork 并在右侧栏打开侧聊；之后的选区复用该标签，侧聊在主会话忙碌无法 fork 时退回新会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:907-963","client.js:995-1029"]}
{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#feature-4","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 的功能「附件发送及文本回退」：发送选区时尝试上传文本附件并提交问题；附件服务不可用或上传失败时发送普通文本，发送失败则恢复引用和草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:752-849"]}
{"unit_id":"123WE-glitch__dsh-selection-actions#caveat-1","repo":"123WE-glitch/dsh-selection-actions","commit":"bc5380df405e352118b48241c86c05b8952c4b1f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Selection Actions 创建侧边会话时会先尝试 fork 主会话；主会话正忙而无法 fork 时会改用不继承上下文的新会话。若选区附件上传不可用，则会将选中文字作为普通文本发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:931-958","client.js:785-818"]}
